# Design handoff bundles — large, and regenerated from the design tool
*-handoff.zip

# Written at build time by scripts/write-config.js (a placeholder is committed)

# The pastel source paintings: 19 PNGs, ~49MB. Deliberately NOT committed — this repo's
# entire app is one HTML file and that weight would sit in every clone forever. The
# shipped covers are assets/covers/*.jpg (~1.8MB, built by tools/build-covers.sh), and
# prompts.json beside these files regenerates the originals if they are ever needed.
design/blueprints/pastel/*.png
